CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'fmt == &perf_hpp__format[PERF_HPP__FREQ]'
#180: FILE: tools/perf/ui/hist.c:114:
+	if (symbol_conf.show_freq_perf &&
+	    ((fmt == &perf_hpp__format[PERF_HPP__FREQ]) ||
+	     (fmt == &perf_hpp__format[PERF_HPP__CPU_U]) ||
+	     (fmt == &perf_hpp__format[PERF_HPP__CORE_BUSY])))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

